<title>HONG KONG: Perfect Treasure posts 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Perfect Treasure posts 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.34 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    74.43</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,451.29</p>
<p>    Company name		 Perfect Treasure Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 24-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Photographic and consumer electrical products distributor Perfect Treasure was listed on the Stock Exchange on July 10, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on application remittances from the listing.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is six H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
